{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work-list", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"facets": {}, "total-results": 4264393, "items": [{"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2025, 10, 8]], "date-time": "2025-10-08T15:21:21Z", "timestamp": 1759936881484}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "RFC Editor", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "DOI": "10.17487/rfc1436", "type": "report", "created": {"date-parts": [[2015, 4, 11]], "date-time": "2015-04-11T01:13:11Z", "timestamp": 1428714791000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 24, "title": ["The Internet Gopher Protocol (a distributed document search and retrieval protocol)"], "prefix": "10.17487", "author": [{"given": "F.", "family": "Anklesaria", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "M.", "family": "McCahill", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "P.", "family": "Lindner", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "D.", "family": "Johnson", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "D.", "family": "Torrey", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "B.", "family": "Albert", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "7045", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[1993, 3]]}, "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2015, 4, 11]], "date-time": "2015-04-11T01:13:55Z", "timestamp": 1428714835000}, "score": 25.623533, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc1436"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[1993, 3]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.17487/rfc1436", "published": {"date-parts": [[1993, 3]]}}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 5, 2]], "date-time": "2026-05-02T21:27:41Z", "timestamp": 1777757261123, "version": "3.51.4"}, "posted": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "group-title": "SSRN", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Elsevier BV", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "abstract": "<jats:p>This paper examines how AI-powered search and agentic commerce are weakening the strategic centrality of the brand homepage. For roughly two decades, the homepage functioned as the brand-controlled entry point where firms sequenced identity, persuasion, comparison, and conversion. That arrangement is being reconfigured as discovery, evaluation, and increasingly checkout migrate into AI-mediated interfaces. Drawing on practice-based observation, conceptual analysis, industry evidence from McKinsey, Adobe, Forrester, OpenAI, and Shopify, and literature on platformization, the paper argues that the homepage is being demoted from persuasive destination to machine-readable infrastructure. The immediate issue is not only traffic displacement but contextual displacement: when evaluation begins inside AI systems, the brand loses control over ordering, framing, and interpretive atmosphere. The paper identifies machine legibilitystructured product data, verifiable claims, interoperable commerce protocols, and trustworthy metadata-as a new competitive prerequisite. It concludes that branding is not disappearing, but its operational center of gravity is shifting from theatrical website design toward evidence, retrieval, and agent-ready architecture.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.2139/ssrn.6542879", "type": "posted-content", "created": {"date-parts": [[2026, 4, 29]], "date-time": "2026-04-29T12:43:55Z", "timestamp": 1777466635000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["From Homepage to Source Document: AI Search, Agentic Commerce, and the Reconfiguration of Brand Discovery"], "prefix": "10.2139", "author": [{"ORCID": "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-7235-009X", "authenticated-orcid": true, "given": "Ercole Egizi", "family": "E.Egizi", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "78", "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2026, 4, 29]], "date-time": "2026-04-29T12:43:56Z", "timestamp": 1777466636000}, "score": 24.021011, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://www.ssrn.com/abstract=6542879"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6542879", "published": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "subtype": "preprint"}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2025, 6, 4]], "date-time": "2025-06-04T04:13:48Z", "timestamp": 1749010428496, "version": "3.41.0"}, "posted": {"date-parts": [[2025]]}, "group-title": "SSRN", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Elsevier BV", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "DOI": "10.2139/ssrn.5195643", "type": "posted-content", "created": {"date-parts": [[2025, 6, 3]], "date-time": "2025-06-03T18:08:27Z", "timestamp": 1748974107000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["AI Powered Document Processing System Using LangChain &amp;amp; Semantic Search"], "prefix": "10.2139", "author": [{"given": "Ms.k.", "family": "Shruthi", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "Tulasi", "family": "Eedara", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "Maniteja", "family": "Suddamshetty", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "Anjali", "family": "Ravva", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "78", "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2025, 6, 3]], "date-time": "2025-06-03T18:08:27Z", "timestamp": 1748974107000}, "score": 23.538721, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://www.ssrn.com/abstract=5195643"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[20